  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 517.03 Proof of Identity",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 517.03 Proof of Identity.\n\n(a) Upon submitting the application as set forth above, the owner shall furnish positive proof of identification to the department.\n\n(b) Proof shall include one or more of the following:\n\n(1) Current driver license or driver license which has expired no more than 12 months prior to the date of application;\n\n(2) Current passport;\n\n(3) Military discharge papers;\n\n(4) Current non-driver identification card or non-driver identification card which has expired no more than 12 months prior to the date of application;\n\n(5) A birth certificate;\n\n(6) Military identification card;\n\n(7) A government issued identification;\n\n(8) An employee photo identification card;\n\n(9) Permanent resident card; or\n\n(10) Naturalization certificate.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 518.03)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
